 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Lakehouse API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Catalogs, databases and tables are Hive-style metastore metadata (formerly BigLake): no Cloud Storage object, Iceberg file, BigQuery table or query engine is read or written. Deletes are immediate and return the deleted resource without deleteTime or expireTime; delete tables before their database and databases before their catalog. tables.list returns full tables for every view; rename, the Iceberg REST catalog and IAM policy methods are unimplemented.",
  "title": "Lakehouse (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
